# 复制成 EXTEND.md 放到：
#   - 项目级（优先）：<项目根>/.ds-skills/ds-imagine/EXTEND.md
#   - 用户级（兜底）：~/.ds-skills/ds-imagine/EXTEND.md

# ds-imagine preferences

## Defaults

- default_provider: openai
- default_quality: 2k
- default_aspect_ratio: 16:9
- default_image_api_dialect: openai-native

## default_model

- openai: gpt-image-2

## Save location

- save_dir: ~/Desktop/cover-image    # 改成你想保存图片的目录
